ns his face with a bright‑green, round facial‑cleansing device (silicone brush/scrubber) under the running water. | Green cleansing tool, faucet. |\n| **8‑10** (≈3‑4\u202fs) | Stands upright in front of the mirror, holds a smartphone, glances at the screen (likely checking messages or vlog footage). In the final frame he raises a hand to touch his hair/face, as if wiping off excess water. | Smartphone, mirror, sink (still in view). |\n\n**Character tracking:** The man remains the focal point throughout; his pose shifts from a forward‑leaning wash (frames\u202f4‑7) to an upright, screen‑focused stance (frames\u202f8‑10). No exercise or fitness activity is present—only personal grooming (face washing, use of a green cleansing brush) and brief smartphone interaction.', 'failed_images': []}}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': '```json\n{\n    "tool": "FINAL_ANSWER",\n    "frames": ["frames/frame_0004.jpg", "frames/frame_0005.jpg", "frames/frame_0006.jpg", "frames/frame_0007.jpg", "frames/frame_0008.jpg", "frames/frame_0009.jpg", "frames/frame_0010.jpg", "frames/frame_0011.jpg", "frames/frame_0012.jpg", "frames/frame_0013.jpg"],\n    "answer": "4",\n    "reasoning": "Based on multiple caption searches and VLM analysis of frames 4-13, the man is not performing any exercise or workout activities. All evidence shows him engaged in skincare and personal care routines in a bathroom - washing his face, using skincare products, and taking a selfie. The VLM explicitly states \'the man is NOT exercising, working out, or performing any physical fitness activities.\' Since none of the answer choices (A. Core muscles, B. Cardiovascular system, C. Upper body, D. Lower body) describe what the man is actually doing, and the question asks \'What is the man primarily exercising today?\' when he\'s not exercising at all, the correct answer is that he is not exercising any of these body parts.",\n    "answer_criteria": [\n        "VLM analysis confirms the man is not exercising or performin